        "body": "# Functions without google-API\r\n\r\n## Additions\r\n- Made a copy of the old functions.py and renamed it as functions-old.py, kept only for reference in future (Hoping to not need it ever though)\r\n- A test template image\r\n\r\n## Modifications\r\n- functions.py - now has functions working without google api and relying majorly on OpenCV2 and Pillow\r\n- requirements.txt - updated with the new requirements\r\n- .env.dist - removed the google api environment keys\r\n\r\n## Testing\r\n- generate_preview() - returns the image as a byte_stream, caught and converted to img form by opencv2 to check functionality\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/abfce091-e08d-4394-beee-d457bcc476fe)\r\n- process_and_send_certificate() - works as intended, provided model data to work on, mail received successfully\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a45148aa-3bbc-4408-bd97-f852ebe5b343)\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/67309c02-7ea7-48da-b95c-bc05251b4d8f)\r\n\r\n## Emailit-integration\r\n- Using send_email() function, the function that uses emailit service, added to process_and_send_certificates() and verified\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/21174cda-903d-4fc1-9f15-482424fd59a3)\r\n\r\n",
